# Typing, a line break, the cursor keys and extending a selection.
# "ab", Enter, "cd" leaves the cursor at line 2 column 3. Left puts it between
# c and d; shift+Left takes the c into a selection, with the cursor before it.
# frames 8
# expect text ab\ncd
# expect cursor 2 1
# expect selection c
# expect modified 1
1 text ab
2 key enter
3 text cd
4 key left
5 key left shift
